<title>USA: Jordan buys 15,000 T California rice - trade.</title>
<headline>Jordan buys 15,000 T California rice - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan has bought 15,000 tonnes of California medium-grain rice, camolino type (oil-coated) on Tuesday for April shipment, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The rice was purchased at $407.00 a tonne, FOT (free on truck), one exporter said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
